WEBVTT

00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:22.805
Tell me nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me I don't
understand anything, but

00:00:22.985 --> 00:00:29.985
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:30.925 --> 00:00:37.725
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:44.835
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:50.705
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:50.985 --> 00:00:54.415
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.185 --> 00:00:59.215
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.485 --> 00:01:05.055
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.455
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.595 --> 00:01:14.365
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:29.915 --> 00:01:34.785
The Solitary Knight

00:01:42.695 --> 00:01:43.925
Found them! This way!

00:01:49.805 --> 00:01:51.235
Gan Drive!

00:01:59.015 --> 00:02:00.275
Wait! Bastard!

00:02:03.215 --> 00:02:04.845
Rai Tornado!

00:02:15.965 --> 00:02:19.735
This type of blade
cannot use Gan Drive.

00:02:21.275 --> 00:02:24.795
Everyone does item
modifications, right?

00:02:25.775 --> 00:02:26.865
Well, then...

00:02:27.075 --> 00:02:30.515
...I'll get every one of them to confess.

00:02:31.785 --> 00:02:33.715
Fools that take pride
in violating the rules!

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:36.985
These people violated the
rules by disregarding...

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:40.455
...the User Consent
Agreement for "The World".

00:02:40.785 --> 00:02:42.815
In accordance with the rules...

00:02:43.955 --> 00:02:46.825
...the player character will be...

00:02:47.025 --> 00:02:48.965
...deleted and their ID will be banned!

00:02:50.635 --> 00:02:51.795
Violated the rules?

00:02:52.035 --> 00:02:53.795
It's probably just item modifications...

00:02:54.105 --> 00:02:55.735
That one at the end...

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.035
...the color of their clothing
is just a little different.

00:02:58.105 --> 00:02:59.365
Eh, seriously?

00:02:59.575 --> 00:03:02.605
Who bothers to read the
User Consent Agreement!

00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:04.315
That ceremoni...

00:03:05.515 --> 00:03:07.745
To think there was such
impudence in "The World".

00:03:11.725 --> 00:03:13.585
We, the Cerulean Knights...

00:03:14.255 --> 00:03:17.525
...believe that the majority of
the users read the agreement...

00:03:18.225 --> 00:03:21.395
...carefully and understand
its purpose when they play.

00:03:27.035 --> 00:03:28.195
Showtime.

00:03:33.105 --> 00:03:35.665
If you're lucky...
You might just escape deletion...

00:03:38.345 --> 00:03:39.405
Fire!

00:03:49.825 --> 00:03:53.355
"Evil will always be destroyed,"
isn't that what they say?

00:03:54.425 --> 00:03:59.525
It is my hope that this
will not happen again!

00:04:00.705 --> 00:04:01.765
That is all!

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:13.145
This is bad.

00:04:13.545 --> 00:04:16.815
Those guys in the Cerulean
Knights are really serious!

00:04:17.415 --> 00:04:18.075
That much?

00:04:18.685 --> 00:04:21.815
Hm. It seems that no matter
how minor the violation...

00:04:22.155 --> 00:04:24.185
...the chances of being
let off are fairly slim.

00:04:24.995 --> 00:04:27.825
Which means, it may
only be a matter of time.

00:04:28.195 --> 00:04:29.225
What is?

00:04:29.595 --> 00:04:31.065
Shugo's bracelet.

00:04:32.565 --> 00:04:36.475
It isn't a part of the CC
Corporation specifications.

00:04:37.675 --> 00:04:39.865
It's not a rare item, then?

00:04:40.445 --> 00:04:41.105
No.

00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:43.965
Fortunately, the Cerulean Knights...

00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:46.915
...didn't see Shugo using his bracelet.

00:04:47.885 --> 00:04:49.815
But if he's discovered he'll
be summarily deleted.

00:04:50.215 --> 00:04:53.585
And the rescue of Rena...

00:05:05.165 --> 00:05:06.195
Shugo!

00:05:06.605 --> 00:05:07.535
Did he hear?

00:05:08.805 --> 00:05:10.465
The conversation will be short then.

00:05:11.035 --> 00:05:13.265
Avoid doing anything
that would stand out.

00:05:13.705 --> 00:05:16.405
You think we'll find Rena
just by sitting around?!

00:05:16.775 --> 00:05:17.505
Shugo.

00:05:17.815 --> 00:05:19.215
You mean to say...

00:05:19.415 --> 00:05:21.385
...they'll find Rena if
we leave it to them?

00:05:27.485 --> 00:05:28.645
Wait, Shugo!

00:05:29.695 --> 00:05:31.625
If you guys won't help...

00:05:31.825 --> 00:05:33.265
...then I'll find Rena by myself!

00:05:33.265 --> 00:05:34.195
Shugo!

00:05:34.225 --> 00:05:35.455
Look down! Down!

00:05:35.965 --> 00:05:36.395
Eh?

00:05:40.135 --> 00:05:41.225
Shugo!

00:05:41.335 --> 00:05:42.365
Are you all right?

00:05:45.375 --> 00:05:49.205
Rena! Rena! Rena! Rena! Rena!

00:05:49.245 --> 00:05:50.405
Shugo!

00:05:50.975 --> 00:05:53.205
I said to avoid doing anything
that would stand out.

00:05:54.085 --> 00:05:57.105
This is concerning the
missing people, correct?

00:05:57.255 --> 00:05:57.615
Yes.

00:05:58.525 --> 00:06:02.385
That duty was given to
the Cerulean Knights.

00:06:02.455 --> 00:06:05.585
But, their methods are too rough.

00:06:05.925 --> 00:06:08.725
If this continues, the users will leave!

00:06:08.965 --> 00:06:11.095
Do you know of any other way?

00:06:11.765 --> 00:06:13.025
Originally, "The World"...

00:06:13.265 --> 00:06:17.565
...was a place for users
to have fun! To...

00:06:18.105 --> 00:06:19.405
You have a distasteful tendency to...

00:06:19.575 --> 00:06:21.805
...try to shield the users too much.

00:06:22.475 --> 00:06:23.535
A fine player cannot be...

00:06:23.615 --> 00:06:26.745
...a fine administrator after all.

00:06:28.885 --> 00:06:32.045
There are times when an
administrator must be harsh.

00:06:32.755 --> 00:06:35.415
Perhaps you should learn
from Kamui's example.

00:06:42.595 --> 00:06:44.185
Like the higher ups say...

00:06:44.495 --> 00:06:45.595
This incident is better off left...

00:06:45.935 --> 00:06:48.425
...to the Cerulean Knights, is it not?

00:06:49.105 --> 00:06:52.135
Did Kamui ask you to say that?

00:06:52.305 --> 00:06:54.205
N-No way.

00:06:54.605 --> 00:06:57.275
I'm completely yours, Lord Balmung.

00:06:57.945 --> 00:07:00.435
You're Kamui's love, aren't you?

00:07:01.115 --> 00:07:02.605
It's a misunderstanding!

00:07:04.185 --> 00:07:05.715
Lord Balmung, where are you going?

00:07:06.025 --> 00:07:07.755
To find the missing people!

00:07:07.855 --> 00:07:09.825
Eh! W-Wait...

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:18.725
Rena. I'll find her no matter what!

00:07:28.615 --> 00:07:31.405
This one's just a normal monster too.

00:07:39.825 --> 00:07:41.255
Tiger Claws!

00:07:49.695 --> 00:07:51.165
Not this one, either.

00:07:55.405 --> 00:07:57.735
Is Shugo really that strong?

00:07:58.105 --> 00:08:01.475
This must be the power of love!

00:08:01.515 --> 00:08:06.645
The brotherly love he feels towards
Rena must be giving him strength.

00:08:06.915 --> 00:08:08.975
I think he just leveled up!

00:08:09.315 --> 00:08:10.545
The love between a
teacher and student.

00:08:11.185 --> 00:08:13.215
The product of my love.

00:08:14.185 --> 00:08:16.685
Hear hear!
Before you go adventuring...

00:08:16.795 --> 00:08:19.595
...make sure you don't forget to save!

00:08:19.865 --> 00:08:22.265
Or you'll be sorry!

00:08:29.235 --> 00:08:30.295
Darn it!

00:08:30.975 --> 00:08:32.305
He's back.

00:08:32.745 --> 00:08:35.335
He's been going out
on his own randomly.

00:08:35.915 --> 00:08:38.815
He's just trying to lure
out one of our monsters.

00:08:39.185 --> 00:08:40.275
Like last time.

00:08:40.945 --> 00:08:43.615
Since he's inviting us.
Shall we accept?

00:08:44.115 --> 00:08:46.385
Those knights are milling around!

00:08:46.425 --> 00:08:47.825
It's a bad idea right now.

00:08:47.955 --> 00:08:49.425
If CC Corporation catches wind of it...

00:08:49.455 --> 00:08:51.085
...our important plan will fail.

00:08:53.025 --> 00:08:54.325
Hear, hear!

00:08:54.465 --> 00:08:58.765
People who haven't saved! Welcome!

00:09:00.035 --> 00:09:01.195
Katsuyuki is calling.

00:09:02.335 --> 00:09:03.205
What's wrong?

00:09:03.775 --> 00:09:04.705
BlackRose.

00:09:05.205 --> 00:09:06.835
Rena has apparently awakened.

00:09:07.075 --> 00:09:07.635
That's impossible!

00:09:07.675 --> 00:09:07.705
Really?

00:09:07.705 --> 00:09:08.435
You're kidding!
Really?

00:09:09.645 --> 00:09:10.445
That's her.

00:09:12.315 --> 00:09:13.115
Why?

00:09:13.485 --> 00:09:15.545
Was there a defect in the software?

00:09:16.355 --> 00:09:19.085
I did it. Just the way I was told to.

00:09:19.525 --> 00:09:20.715
This can't be.

00:09:22.295 --> 00:09:23.185
I'll go confirm.

00:09:26.325 --> 00:09:28.555
It appears that...

00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:30.665
...I'm back where I started.

00:09:31.865 --> 00:09:35.265
It seems that the basic construction of
this place is like that of a normal area.

00:09:36.105 --> 00:09:37.865
There's something like a dungeon...

00:09:38.405 --> 00:09:40.435
...but without the monsters and lights.

00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:42.705
Have you figured out
where place this is yet?

00:09:45.685 --> 00:09:48.015
The fact that I am but a
shadowed existence...

00:09:48.515 --> 00:09:52.355
...would mean that we are
cut off from "The World".

00:09:53.485 --> 00:09:55.585
But I can still communicate with you.

00:09:56.595 --> 00:10:00.115
It's like we're not completely
not connected to "The World".

00:10:00.795 --> 00:10:03.455
If only we could find
some kind of clue.

00:10:28.155 --> 00:10:31.055
So what is that illegal
player character saying?

00:10:31.765 --> 00:10:32.415
That...

00:10:32.565 --> 00:10:34.655
It's not like I'm this way
because I want to be.

00:10:35.135 --> 00:10:36.425
It's his fault.

00:10:41.465 --> 00:10:43.695
I was saying!

00:10:44.175 --> 00:10:47.195
It's not like I'm this way
because I want to be!

00:10:47.575 --> 00:10:49.545
I'm a victim, I tell you!

00:10:50.075 --> 00:10:54.345
I was trying a restart to try
to return to my normal self!

00:11:00.625 --> 00:11:02.145
No matter what I try...

00:11:02.255 --> 00:11:06.195
...this is as close to normal
as I can get! Ribbit!

00:11:06.565 --> 00:11:09.655
When I was turned into a fish,
things went back to normal quickly.

00:11:09.935 --> 00:11:13.565
My good looks have
been lost forever! Ribbit.

00:11:15.775 --> 00:11:17.235
What's so funny?

00:11:17.675 --> 00:11:19.405
It appears to be crying.

00:11:20.345 --> 00:11:21.305
This is all Kunisaki's fault.

00:11:21.575 --> 00:11:23.235
Because he used some...

00:11:23.345 --> 00:11:26.785
...technique called a Data Drain on me.

00:11:28.085 --> 00:11:30.385
Data... Drain you say?

00:11:31.515 --> 00:11:33.355
Who is this Kunisaki?

00:11:33.985 --> 00:11:35.045
Tell me more.

00:11:36.155 --> 00:11:37.525
I understand. Ribbit!

00:11:39.925 --> 00:11:42.325
Kunisaki's real name is Shugo Kunisaki.

00:11:42.635 --> 00:11:45.065
He's called Shugo here.

00:11:45.705 --> 00:11:47.895
He looks like this!

00:11:49.505 --> 00:11:50.335
He's...

00:11:50.735 --> 00:11:53.035
He was with Lord Balmung.

00:11:56.945 --> 00:11:58.605
This is getting interesting.

00:12:09.395 --> 00:12:12.385
Could this be Aura?

00:12:13.965 --> 00:12:16.225
You're not a shadow!

00:12:16.535 --> 00:12:17.725
Thank goodness!

00:12:18.165 --> 00:12:19.695
Y-yeah.

00:12:19.805 --> 00:12:21.965
How did you get here?

00:12:22.335 --> 00:12:24.035
What area is this?

00:12:24.175 --> 00:12:26.295
What Root Town is this connected to?

00:12:26.745 --> 00:12:30.405
U-um... I don't know.

00:12:31.115 --> 00:12:33.445
I snuck onto my brother's PC...

00:12:33.715 --> 00:12:35.745
...and arrived here all of a sudden.

00:12:35.855 --> 00:12:37.245
Then, your older brother?

00:12:37.485 --> 00:12:38.785
Is he nearby?

00:12:42.325 --> 00:12:43.555
H-hey! You!

00:12:44.555 --> 00:12:45.495
Aura is there!

00:12:45.795 --> 00:12:47.695
She woke up Rena.

00:12:48.165 --> 00:12:49.725
Did you say... Aura?

00:12:50.095 --> 00:12:51.125
Have you forgotten?

00:12:51.265 --> 00:12:53.065
The one that gave Shugo the bracelet.

00:12:53.305 --> 00:12:54.665
That's right.

00:12:55.005 --> 00:12:55.865
What should we do?

00:12:56.675 --> 00:12:57.465
Wait a sec.

00:12:57.775 --> 00:12:59.035
I'll contact her.

00:13:04.175 --> 00:13:04.975
There's trouble.

00:13:05.145 --> 00:13:06.675
Something unexpected has happened.

00:13:08.315 --> 00:13:09.785
Understood.

00:13:11.315 --> 00:13:13.415
Hey. Wake up!

00:13:14.025 --> 00:13:16.825
If I can access this child's logs...

00:13:17.295 --> 00:13:19.225
...I may be able to
discover something.

00:13:19.565 --> 00:13:20.155
I see!

00:13:20.995 --> 00:13:22.725
Hayato, Logout!

00:13:22.935 --> 00:13:24.555
Our data is being read!

00:13:24.795 --> 00:13:25.395
Okay!

00:13:28.735 --> 00:13:30.895
Ah! W-Wait!

00:13:31.105 --> 00:13:33.435
I'm in a bit of a fix here you know!

00:13:33.675 --> 00:13:34.935
Did you find out anything?

00:13:36.945 --> 00:13:37.915
JP.

00:13:38.445 --> 00:13:39.205
Huh?

00:13:39.985 --> 00:13:41.345
JP Server.

00:13:41.955 --> 00:13:45.115
It means we're within
the Japanese server.

00:13:45.325 --> 00:13:46.375
Japanese?

00:13:51.695 --> 00:13:53.385
Maybe I'll take a little break.

00:13:53.895 --> 00:13:55.055
Hear, hear!

00:13:55.195 --> 00:13:58.995
...you should save before
you go out adventuring...

00:13:59.565 --> 00:14:01.865
...otherwise you'll be sorry later.

00:14:02.535 --> 00:14:03.905
You're Shugo, aren't you?

00:14:05.035 --> 00:14:07.435
Have you found Rena?

00:14:08.915 --> 00:14:11.075
In the name of the Cerulean Knights...

00:14:11.545 --> 00:14:14.075
...you are being taken into
custody under suspicion...

00:14:14.415 --> 00:14:15.405
...of illegal data tampering.

00:14:18.885 --> 00:14:20.755
Who ever heard of
something that stupid!

00:14:21.055 --> 00:14:23.485
You're supposed to find the
people that kidnapped Rena!

00:14:23.925 --> 00:14:25.585
You're one of the suspects!

00:14:26.465 --> 00:14:27.355
Take him in!

00:14:29.765 --> 00:14:32.195
I come back to
"The World" after all this time...

00:14:33.005 --> 00:14:34.935
...and find a bunch of gangsters
calling themselves knights...

00:14:35.105 --> 00:14:37.125
...and acting as if
they owned the place.

00:14:38.175 --> 00:14:39.805
How wretched.

00:14:41.745 --> 00:14:43.405
We, the Cerulean Knights...

00:14:43.775 --> 00:14:46.305
...act in the name of
Justice within "The World"!

00:14:46.985 --> 00:14:47.875
Are you mocking us?!

00:14:48.285 --> 00:14:48.845
Justice?

00:14:50.155 --> 00:14:51.645
I have much to say...

00:14:52.085 --> 00:14:53.745
...if you intend to speak
to me about justice.

00:14:57.155 --> 00:14:58.625
Raging Plasma!

00:15:05.805 --> 00:15:06.565
Are you all right?

00:15:07.035 --> 00:15:07.835
You're!

00:15:09.105 --> 00:15:11.665
I was a man who was
once called a knight!

00:15:14.745 --> 00:15:17.335
Leave this to me and run!

00:15:19.845 --> 00:15:21.715
You who know nothing of justice...

00:15:22.055 --> 00:15:24.045
...blindly waving your swords about.

00:15:25.115 --> 00:15:26.915
Foolish Cerulean Knights!

00:15:29.025 --> 00:15:32.615
Feel the power of true justice!

00:15:33.125 --> 00:15:34.855
Data Drain!

00:15:44.035 --> 00:15:44.935
I see.

00:15:46.245 --> 00:15:48.075
You run too!

00:15:52.145 --> 00:15:53.515
Compatriots of the scarecrows?

00:15:54.215 --> 00:15:55.405
This will take some work.

00:15:58.055 --> 00:16:00.025
Strengthen the protection
around that area.

00:16:01.225 --> 00:16:02.785
Then Aura will disappear.

00:16:03.325 --> 00:16:04.015
That's right.

00:16:04.525 --> 00:16:05.215
Understood.

00:16:05.465 --> 00:16:06.325
How do I do that?

00:16:06.865 --> 00:16:08.195
I've never done that before!

00:16:09.235 --> 00:16:12.925
We're going to use a
strengthening program.

00:16:13.935 --> 00:16:14.665
We begin work immediately...

00:16:15.035 --> 00:16:16.195
...as soon as it's done.

00:16:17.575 --> 00:16:18.195
Roger.

00:16:19.475 --> 00:16:20.775
Hey, that's...

00:16:20.845 --> 00:16:21.575
Could it be?

00:16:21.845 --> 00:16:22.505
In the past...

00:16:22.575 --> 00:16:24.635
...he was known world-wide
within "The World"...

00:16:24.975 --> 00:16:25.945
...as the legendary warrior.

00:16:30.715 --> 00:16:31.685
Silver Knight!

00:16:32.055 --> 00:16:33.045
Is that...

00:16:33.325 --> 00:16:36.015
...related to the tangerine
and can be used as medicine?

00:16:36.155 --> 00:16:39.595
That's a Kumquat. Silver not Gold!

00:16:40.225 --> 00:16:41.595
I'm sorry.

00:16:42.065 --> 00:16:43.125
Do you know him?

00:16:43.695 --> 00:16:46.295
Any long-time users would know him.

00:16:47.205 --> 00:16:47.895
Silver Knight.

00:16:48.935 --> 00:16:51.595
There used to be a group
known as the Crimson Knights.

00:16:52.005 --> 00:16:54.135
He was their captain.

00:16:56.245 --> 00:16:59.405
This one resisted us,
the Cerulean Knights...

00:17:00.015 --> 00:17:02.575
...and assisted in the
escape of an illegal user.

00:17:03.155 --> 00:17:05.885
For that his player character will...

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:08.255
...be deleted and his
ID will be banned.

00:17:08.795 --> 00:17:10.985
To think that you are the
leader of the knights.

00:17:11.425 --> 00:17:12.415
The end is near.

00:17:15.225 --> 00:17:16.855
Those that would
stand above others...

00:17:17.195 --> 00:17:18.395
...must have noble ideals
and noble intentions!

00:17:18.635 --> 00:17:21.105
Anyone that cannot
manage themselves...

00:17:21.835 --> 00:17:25.965
...rigidly is not fit to serve
as a leader of knights!

00:17:26.575 --> 00:17:27.265
To say...

00:17:27.705 --> 00:17:30.175
...you're punishing someone
for standing up to you?

00:17:30.875 --> 00:17:33.365
That kind of justice... is a lie!

00:17:34.245 --> 00:17:37.215
We are an official section
of CC Corporation.

00:17:38.085 --> 00:17:41.025
If you have problems
with that, then don't play!

00:17:41.555 --> 00:17:43.755
You mean, you'll kill us?

00:17:44.725 --> 00:17:46.755
Then don't call that justice!

00:17:47.425 --> 00:17:49.955
Call it what it truly is... mass murder!

00:17:52.665 --> 00:17:53.655
Remember this!

00:17:54.135 --> 00:17:57.965
Knights, you must not clad
yourself in justice all the time!

00:17:58.605 --> 00:17:59.765
If you forget that...

00:18:00.605 --> 00:18:02.165
...you are nothing more than
an Emperor without his clothes!

00:18:18.325 --> 00:18:19.195
Fire!

00:18:34.075 --> 00:18:37.515
Lady Subaru!

00:19:02.375 --> 00:19:04.735
An emergency. Extremely urgent?

00:19:06.205 --> 00:19:07.295
What is the problem?

00:19:07.575 --> 00:19:08.975
I am quite busy.

00:19:09.545 --> 00:19:12.035
Perhaps busy searching
for the missing people?

00:19:14.685 --> 00:19:16.875
We have had a report
from your underling.

00:19:18.585 --> 00:19:19.285
Reki!

00:19:19.425 --> 00:19:21.385
I do believe that I had assigned the...

00:19:21.755 --> 00:19:25.385
...missing persons case
to the Cerulean Knights?

00:19:26.395 --> 00:19:27.225
But!

00:19:27.795 --> 00:19:29.025
It would seem that...

00:19:29.165 --> 00:19:31.465
...administrating does not suit you.

00:19:33.135 --> 00:19:35.325
As of this moment...

00:19:35.535 --> 00:19:38.525
...you will be removed from the
system administration staff.

00:19:38.905 --> 00:19:40.275
Your powers as an
administrator will all...

00:19:40.345 --> 00:19:43.035
...be revoked and transferred
to another department.

00:19:44.045 --> 00:19:48.105
You may return to "The World"...

00:19:48.215 --> 00:19:52.175
...as one of its users
and enjoy it as a hobby.

00:19:55.385 --> 00:19:56.785
It is true, Balmung has...

00:19:57.795 --> 00:19:58.285
Yes.

00:19:58.895 --> 00:20:00.655
It appears he is still with
CC Corporation but...

00:20:01.865 --> 00:20:04.265
I would have liked to
have used the discovery...

00:20:04.595 --> 00:20:06.495
...of his involvement with Shugo
as a reason to delete him myself.

00:20:07.605 --> 00:20:10.095
Oh well. He can't do
anything as a simple user.

00:20:13.345 --> 00:20:15.635
Hmph. You're harsh too.

00:20:16.075 --> 00:20:18.135
Selling out your own
superior to the company.

00:20:19.015 --> 00:20:22.645
I am not paid by Balmung.

00:20:23.985 --> 00:20:24.345
Besides...

00:20:25.215 --> 00:20:28.215
...I'm your love, right?

00:20:30.625 --> 00:20:32.525
The back. Search the back!

00:20:33.325 --> 00:20:34.055
Well?

00:20:34.325 --> 00:20:36.925
No, We found no one.

00:20:37.395 --> 00:20:39.525
The search is going on
through every area.

00:20:40.035 --> 00:20:42.335
It will just be a matter of
time before he is caught.

00:20:42.675 --> 00:20:43.395
Yeah.

00:20:45.775 --> 00:20:47.175
From that data I have determined a...

00:20:47.605 --> 00:20:51.135
...place in "The World"
where access is possible.

00:20:51.645 --> 00:20:52.805
If we use this...

00:20:53.815 --> 00:20:54.805
Can I get back?

00:20:55.145 --> 00:20:57.315
If the sent mail is received.

00:20:58.155 --> 00:20:58.945
I see.

00:20:59.685 --> 00:21:01.915
But if you can send the mail.

00:21:02.255 --> 00:21:04.415
The recipient may be able to...

00:21:04.855 --> 00:21:07.355
...analyze it to reach this area.

00:21:07.725 --> 00:21:09.955
I see! What's wrong, Aura?

00:21:10.365 --> 00:21:12.165
The protection in this area...

00:21:12.565 --> 00:21:13.895
...is strengthening.

00:21:14.535 --> 00:21:16.665
Hurry, the mail.

00:21:19.105 --> 00:21:21.195
Hey, Shugo! Get this!

00:21:43.865 --> 00:21:44.355
Huh?

00:21:46.565 --> 00:21:47.435
Rena!

00:21:50.175 --> 00:21:50.605
Preview

00:21:50.605 --> 00:21:51.535
Preview
Big brother...

00:21:51.535 --> 00:21:51.605
Preview

00:21:51.605 --> 00:21:53.975
Preview
If you don't find me soon,
I'm gonna to be angry.

00:21:53.975 --> 00:21:54.045
Preview

00:21:54.045 --> 00:21:54.875
Preview
Positively seething!

00:21:54.875 --> 00:21:55.005
Preview

00:21:55.005 --> 00:21:56.075
Preview
Putting that aside...

00:21:56.075 --> 00:21:56.175
Preview

00:21:56.175 --> 00:21:56.875
Preview
...I have event information!

00:21:56.875 --> 00:21:57.805
...I have event information!

00:21:58.315 --> 00:21:58.805
In the area...

00:21:58.875 --> 00:22:02.175
..."Dying Destroyer's Grave"
the Cerulean Knights are...

00:22:02.315 --> 00:22:05.015
Footsteps of Collapse

00:22:06.655 --> 00:22:17.085
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai goe ni
In the running
children's frolicking voices

00:22:17.465 --> 00:22:24.995
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.275 --> 00:22:38.745
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:39.055 --> 00:22:47.825
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:49.165 --> 00:22:59.365
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the hands picking,
the emerald green flowers

00:22:59.805 --> 00:23:10.305
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.585 --> 00:23:22.485
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo
hiraita mabushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened its eyes to that beauty,

00:23:22.835 --> 00:23:30.435
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
